{"sections":{"1765355219810d3e37":{"type":"_blocks","blocks":{"ai_gen_block_2e18227_U3MpHQ":{"type":"ai_gen_block_2e18227","settings":{"event_title":"Hot Mat Pilates for Runners","event_date_time":"Saturday, December 14 • 7:00 AM","event_venue":"YellowStripe Dance Co.","venue_maps_link":"","hero_cta_label":"Book Early Bird Ticket","hero_title_size":56,"hero_details_size":20,"hero_text_color":"#ffffff","hero_cta_bg":"#9b046f","hero_cta_text":"#ffffff","hero_cta_hover_bg":"#86106a","description_title":"About This Session","description_content":"<p>Join Delhi Run Collective for an energizing Hot Mat Pilates session designed specifically for runners. This 60-minute class focuses on building core strength, improving flexibility, and enhancing mobility—essential elements for injury prevention and performance improvement.<\/p><p>Whether you're training for your next race or looking to complement your running routine, this session offers the perfect balance of challenge and recovery. Led by certified instructors from Banana Burn, you'll experience a premium workout in a supportive community environment.<\/p><p>What makes this special: Post-session brewed coffee, community connections, and expert guidance tailored to runners' needs.<\/p>","tickets_title":"Choose Your Ticket","show_early_bird_badge":true,"early_bird_badge_text":"Limited Time","early_bird_name":"Early Bird","early_bird_price":"₹799","early_bird_description":"<p>Discounted pricing for early sign-ups. Includes full class access and a brewed coffee before the session.<\/p>","early_bird_cta":"Buy Early Bird","early_bird_link":"","standard_name":"Standard Ticket","standard_price":"₹999","standard_description":"<p>General admission for the session. Includes full class access and community perks.<\/p>","standard_cta":"Buy Standard Ticket","standard_link":"","details_title":"Event Details","detail_date_time":"Saturday, December 14, 2024<br>7:00 AM - 8:00 AM","detail_venue_name":"YellowStripe Dance Co.","detail_venue_a